        <mxCell id="dt-legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Box = class, package or external system. The second line is its project or layer.&lt;br&gt;Line without arrowhead = dependency, read top-down: a box depends on the boxes below it. Services reach repositories and SystemClock through their interfaces.&lt;br&gt;(F) + dashed grey box = fake that is never replaced: integration tests sign their own test tokens instead of using Keycloak." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#173330;fontColor=#173330;fontSize=12;fontFamily=Arial;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="540" width="358" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
